 reviews[0].bodyEn=['I arrived after lights-out. The night attendant asked no questions; he slid a key and a lamp across the desk. The table in my room was narrow, but it held the ledger.','The shift-change bells still carried through the window. Yet the hot water arrived exactly when promised. When you have to leave early, that can matter more than silence.'];
